{"route":"/docs/5.3/utilities/link/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Link","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Link utilities are used to stylize your anchors to adjust their color, opacity, underline offset, underline color, and more."},"blocks":[{"id":"link-opacity","type":"heading","en":"Link opacity","level":2},{"id":"link-opacity--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Change the alpha opacity of the link <code>rgba()</code> color value with utilities. Please be aware that changes to a color’s opacity can lead to links with <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/accessibility/#color-contrast\"><em>insufficient</em> contrast</a>."},{"id":"link-opacity--example-1","type":"demo","key":"070f3940c822b078d876","height":300},{"id":"link-opacity--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p><a class=\"link-opacity-10\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 10</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-25\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 25</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-50\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 50</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-75\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 75</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-100\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 100</a></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"link-opacity--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"You can even change the opacity level on hover."},{"id":"link-opacity--example-2","type":"demo","key":"d6e8d086d61c889d2194","height":300},{"id":"link-opacity--code-2","type":"code","value":"<p><a class=\"link-opacity-10-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 10</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-25-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 25</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-50-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 50</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-75-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 75</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-100-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 100</a></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"link-underlines","type":"heading","en":"Link underlines","level":2},{"id":"underline-color","type":"heading","en":"Underline color","level":3},{"id":"underline-color--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Change the underline’s color independent of the link text color."},{"id":"underline-color--example-1","type":"demo","key":"231aeedbe7e9ba30772c","height":300},{"id":"underline-color--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-primary\">Primary underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-secondary\">Secondary underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-success\">Success underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-danger\">Danger underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-warning\">Warning underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-info\">Info underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-light\">Light underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-dark\">Dark underline</a></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"underline-offset","type":"heading","en":"Underline offset","level":3},{"id":"underline-offset--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Change the underline’s distance from your text. Offset is set in <code>em</code> units to automatically scale with the element’s current <code>font-size</code>."},{"id":"underline-offset--example-1","type":"demo","key":"28078b657fb8d5e3981a","height":228},{"id":"underline-offset--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p><a href=\"#\">Default link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-1\" href=\"#\">Offset 1 link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2\" href=\"#\">Offset 2 link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-3\" href=\"#\">Offset 3 link</a></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"underline-opacity","type":"heading","en":"Underline opacity","level":3},{"id":"underline-opacity--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Change the underline’s opacity. Requires adding <code>.link-underline</code> to first set an <code>rgba()</code> color we use to then modify the alpha opacity."},{"id":"underline-opacity--example-1","type":"demo","key":"0b0bfdf1efadc06ecce9","height":300},{"id":"underline-opacity--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-0\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 0</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-10\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 10</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-25\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 25</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-50\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 50</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-75\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 75</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-100\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 100</a></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"hover-variants","type":"heading","en":"Hover variants","level":3},{"id":"hover-variants--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Just like the <code>.link-opacity-*-hover</code> utilities, <code>.link-offset</code> and <code>.link-underline-opacity</code> utilities include <code>:hover</code> variants by default. Mix and match to create unique link styles."},{"id":"hover-variants--example-1","type":"demo","key":"78c95fd4417fb17ea732","height":147},{"id":"hover-variants--code-1","type":"code","value":"<a class=\"link-offset-2 link-offset-3-hover link-underline link-underline-opacity-0 link-underline-opacity-75-hover\" href=\"#\">\n  Underline opacity 0\n</a>","language":"html"},{"id":"colored-links","type":"heading","en":"Colored links","level":2},{"id":"colored-links--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/helpers/colored-links/\">Colored link helpers</a> have been updated to pair with our link utilities. Use the new utilities to modify the link opacity, underline opacity, and underline offset."},{"id":"colored-links--example-1","type":"demo","key":"7df87b1a66e9c147b930","height":300},{"id":"colored-links--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-primary link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Primary link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-secondary link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Secondary link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-success link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Success link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-danger link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Danger link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-warning link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Warning link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-info link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Info link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-light link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Light link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-dark link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Dark link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-body-emphasis link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-75-hover\">Emphasis link</a></p>","language":"html"},{"id":"colored-links--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"colored-links--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Accessibility tip:</strong> Using color to add meaning only provides a visual indication, which will not be conveyed to users of assistive technologies like screen readers. Please ensure the meaning is obvious from the content itself (e.g., the visible text with a <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/accessibility/#color-contrast\"><em>sufficient</em> color contrast</a>) or is included through alternative means, such as additional text hidden with the <code>.visually-hidden</code> class."}]},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"css--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"In addition to the following Sass functionality, consider reading about our included <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/css-variables\">CSS custom properties</a> (aka CSS variables) for colors and more."},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Link utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"link-opacity\": (\n  css-var: true,\n  class: link-opacity,\n  state: hover,\n  values: (\n    10: .1,\n    25: .25,\n    50: .5,\n    75: .75,\n    100: 1\n  )\n),\n\"link-offset\": (\n  property: text-underline-offset,\n  class: link-offset,\n  state: hover,\n  values: (\n    1: .125em,\n    2: .25em,\n    3: .375em,\n  )\n),\n\"link-underline\": (\n  property: text-decoration-color,\n  class: link-underline,\n  local-vars: (\n    \"link-underline-opacity\": 1\n  ),\n  values: map-merge(\n    $utilities-links-underline,\n    (\n      null: rgba(var(--#{$prefix}link-color-rgb), var(--#{$prefix}link-underline-opacity, 1)),\n    )\n  )\n),\n\"link-underline-opacity\": (\n  css-var: true,\n  class: link-underline-opacity,\n  state: hover,\n  values: (\n    0: 0,\n    10: .1,\n    25: .25,\n    50: .5,\n    75: .75,\n    100: 1\n  ),\n),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"070f3940c822b078d876","html":" <p><a class=\"link-opacity-10\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 10</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-25\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 25</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-50\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 50</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-75\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 75</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-100\" href=\"#\">Link opacity 100</a></p> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d6e8d086d61c889d2194","html":" <p><a class=\"link-opacity-10-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 10</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-25-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 25</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-50-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 50</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-75-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 75</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-opacity-100-hover\" href=\"#\">Link hover opacity 100</a></p> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"231aeedbe7e9ba30772c","html":" <p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-primary\">Primary underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-secondary\">Secondary underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-success\">Success underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-danger\">Danger underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-warning\">Warning underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-info\">Info underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-light\">Light underline</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-underline-dark\">Dark underline</a></p> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"28078b657fb8d5e3981a","html":" <p><a href=\"#\">Default link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-1\" href=\"#\">Offset 1 link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2\" href=\"#\">Offset 2 link</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-3\" href=\"#\">Offset 3 link</a></p> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"0b0bfdf1efadc06ecce9","html":" <p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-0\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 0</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-10\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 10</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-25\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 25</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-50\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 50</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-75\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 75</a></p>\n<p><a class=\"link-offset-2 link-underline link-underline-opacity-100\" href=\"#\">Underline opacity 100</a></p> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"78c95fd4417fb17ea732","html":" <a class=\"link-offset-2 link-offset-3-hover link-underline link-underline-opacity-0 link-underline-opacity-75-hover\" href=\"#\">\n  Underline opacity 0\n</a> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"7df87b1a66e9c147b930","html":" <p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-primary link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Primary link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-secondary link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Secondary link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-success link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Success link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-danger link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Danger link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-warning link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Warning link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-info link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Info link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-light link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Light link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-dark link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-100-hover\">Dark link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"link-body-emphasis link-offset-2 link-underline-opacity-25 link-underline-opacity-75-hover\">Emphasis link</a></p> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"